From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:46:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 269/289] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the queued
 Compact

The prepare turn now counts as started only when the server reports the session
running, not on the send latch, a background shell or a queued message, and the
start limit applies either way. A prepare turn that ended failed or cancelled, or
raised an error, compacts nothing. A background shell count from an older runner
also blocks the safe point.
---
 web/src/lib/aeCompactPlan.test.ts | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 web/src/lib/aeCompactPlan.ts      | 57 ++++++++++++++------
 2 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

